{"unit_id":"ACGsu__dsh-sidebar-panel-fold#card-zh","repo":"ACGsu/dsh-sidebar-panel-fold","commit":"7353d026fe87d4e87b74ea3ba4dac6efd4bf1bec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-panel-fold 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的侧边栏界面插件，可把全局面板列表收纳成一行。它在面板列表前插入控制行，收起后显示当前面板摘要，并通过浮层列出面板供切换。主要功能包括收起与展开列表、显示当前面板图标和名称、从浮层切换面板，以及跟随动态增删的面板更新。适合希望减少侧边栏占用、仍能快速切换面板的 DSH 用户。状态可通过 DSH 设置保存；无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:181-187","src/client.js:400-550","src/index.js:51-69"]}
{"unit_id":"ACGsu__dsh-sidebar-panel-fold#card-en","repo":"ACGsu/dsh-sidebar-panel-fold","commit":"7353d026fe87d4e87b74ea3ba4dac6efd4bf1bec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-panel-fold folds the DSH web and desktop sidebar panel list into one row. It shows the active panel and opens a popover to switch panels. It tracks panel changes and remembers fold state through DSH settings or localStorage. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:181-187","src/client.js:400-550","src/index.js:51-69"]}
